SUMMARY:Special Event: MC Hammersmith
LOCATION:Helium Comedy Club\, 2031 Sansom Street\, Philadelphia
DESCRIPTION:In his live shows\, MC Hammersmith performs improvised hip hop 
 comedy. He is a freestyle rapper - meaning he raps spontaneously\, unscript
 ed\, with absolutely no preparation. The lyrics and rhymes of his raps are 
 100% improvised and based entirely on crowd suggestions.\n\nHe takes storie
 s and suggestions from audience members\, then raps about them at lightning
  speed. Mind-blowing\, hilarious\, and completely different every single ti
 me.\n\nMC Hammersmith (real name Will Naameh) grew up attending an all-male
 \, middle-class private school in the suburb of Hammersmith\, west London. 
 After escaping this\, he took up improv classes while studying for a degree
  in Linguistics at the University of Edinburgh. Combining his love for ling
 uistics\, improvisation\, and hip hop\, he first started performing solo fr
 eestyle rap comedy in 2016.\n\nSince then\, he has sold out nationwide solo
  comedy tours\, won multiple comedy awards for his freestyle rap performanc
 es\, gained over half a billion views for his online videos\, and supported
  Jason Manford on his arena tour of the UK. Now based in Edinburgh\, he is 
 a highly in-demand act for festivals\, cabaret shows\, and corporate events
  worldwide.\n\nCouple's Package includes:\n\n- 2 premium seats\n- $90 food 
 & beverage credit ($45 per person)\n- Gratuity\n- Ticket Protection\n\nMana
 gement reserves the right to prevent customers from entering the facility w
 ho they deem disruptive or dangerous to other patrons.\nMore info: https://
 comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/special-event-mc-hammersmith-24304/
